.TH "LARGESTCONTENTFULPAINT.PRESENTATIONTIME" "3JS" "May 22, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
LargestContentfulPaint.presentationTime \- LargestContentfulPaint:
presentationTime property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]presentationTime\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]LargestContentfulPaint\f[R] interface returns the
\f[CR]timestamp\f[R] when the painted pixels were actually drawn on the
screen.
.PP
The \f[CR]presentationTime\f[R] is optional \(em some browsers may
choose always to return \f[CR]0\f[R] or not to expose the value at all.
The value is also implementation\-dependent \(em it may differ across
browsers that choose to expose it.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]DOMHighResTimeStamp\f[R] or \f[CR]null\f[R] if the value is not
exposed.
.SH EXAMPLES
See Observing separate paint and presentation timings.
.SH SEE ALSO
